WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.401 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Chloe, you do
so many great impressions,

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:03.870 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I wanted to challenge yo
to something fun.

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.638 align:start size:94% position:6%
We all want to
get in the holiday spirit,

00:00:05.638 --> 00:00:07.007 line:92%
so here's what we're gonna do.

00:00:07.007 --> 00:00:09.542 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'd love you to start
reading the classic poem

00:00:09.542 --> 00:00:11.644 align:start size:94% position:6%
"'Twas the Night
Before Christmas," okay?

00:00:11.644 --> 00:00:14.914
And as you're reading, there
will be names of celebrities

00:00:14.914 --> 00:00:16.016 line:92%
that pop up onscreen, okay

00:00:16.016 --> 00:00:19.386 align:start size:94% position:6%
So you'll keep reading
but in the voice of whoeve
comes up next.

00:00:19.386 --> 00:00:21.788 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you could wear that scar
if you'd like to.

00:00:21.788 --> 00:00:24.357 align:start size:94% position:6%
You don't have to.
-Ooh! Well, it does
match my outfit.

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:27.494 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It actually really does.
-Yeah. Holiday vibes!

00:00:27.494 --> 00:00:28.528 line:92%
-Okay, here we go. Ready?

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:30.230 align:start size:94% position:6%
Whenever you're ready,
you can start

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:34.034
with the first impression
that appears on the screen

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:34.601 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
right over there.

00:00:34.601 --> 00:00:36.669 align:start size:94% position:6%
Ruth, can we get
some sleigh bells?

00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:37.804 line:92%
[ Sleigh bells jingling ]

00:00:37.804 --> 00:00:39.539 align:start size:94% position:6%
All right, here we go.
-[ As Reese Witherspoon ] Okay

00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:41.641 align:start size:94% position:6%
Ahem. Okay, 'twas the nigh
before Christmas,

00:00:41.641 --> 00:00:44.544
when all through the house
not a creature was stirring,

00:00:44.544 --> 00:00:46.780 align:start size:94% position:6%
not even a fierce
little mouse, y'all!

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:48.982 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughing ] Okay.
[ Bell dings ]

00:00:48.982 --> 00:00:49.883 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-[ Normal voice ] Okay.

00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:52.218 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ As Drew Barrymore ]
The children were nestled

00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:55.388 line:92%
all snug in their amazing beds

00:00:55.388 --> 00:00:59.692 align:start size:94% position:6%
while visions of
the most gorgeous sugarplums

00:00:59.692 --> 00:01:02.462 size:78% position:39% line:92%
danced in their head.

00:01:02.462 --> 00:01:03.863 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Bell dings ]
-[ Laughing ]

00:01:03.863 --> 00:01:05.965 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Normal voice ] Oh!
Okay, this one.

00:01:05.965 --> 00:01:08.535
-Margaret Thatcher.
-You got the teeth -- the teeth.

00:01:08.535 --> 00:01:11.137 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ As Margaret Thatcher ]
When out on the lawn,

00:01:11.137 --> 00:01:14.374 align:start size:94% position:6%
there arose
an unfavorable clatter,

00:01:14.374 --> 00:01:22.248
I sprang from my bedchambers
to see what was the matter

00:01:22.248 --> 00:01:24.551 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughing ] Oh, my God!
[ Bell dings ]

00:01:24.551 --> 00:01:26.152 line:92%
-[ Normal voice ] Oh, good

00:01:26.152 --> 00:01:28.988
I have to pretend this is
a shawl for Nicole Kidman.

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:30.690 align:start size:94% position:6%
-All right.
-Okay.

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:31.357 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Breathes deeply ]

00:01:31.357 --> 00:01:34.727
[ As Nicole Kidman ] Away to the
window I jumped like a 'roo,

00:01:34.727 --> 00:01:39.365 align:start size:94% position:6%
tore open the shutters,
and [laughs]

00:01:39.365 --> 00:01:42.435 size:84% position:42% line:92%
oh, my God what a view.

00:01:42.435 --> 00:01:44.003 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, my God.
[ Bell dings ]

00:01:44.003 --> 00:01:46.773 size:81% position:41%
-[ Normal voice ] Oh.
All right, here we go.

00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:49.776
[ As Phoebe Waller-Bridge
'Twas a little old chap

00:01:49.776 --> 00:01:50.944 size:75% position:38% line:92%
so cheeky and quick,

00:01:50.944 --> 00:01:54.647 align:start size:94% position:6%
I knew in a moment
he must be St. Nick.

00:01:54.647 --> 00:01:57.550 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughing ]
[ Bell dings ]

00:01:58.751 --> 00:02:01.921 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ As Timothée Chalamet ]
Uh, he -- he had a broad fac

00:02:01.921 --> 00:02:04.357 line:92%
and a, uh, little round bell

00:02:04.357 --> 00:02:07.327 align:start size:94% position:6%
that shook when he laughed
like a bowl of jelly.

00:02:07.327 --> 00:02:09.896 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughs ]
Nah, nah, nah.

00:02:09.896 --> 00:02:13.366 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm sorry, Nick.
Nah, nah, nah.

00:02:13.366 --> 00:02:14.334 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Bell dings ]

00:02:14.334 --> 00:02:16.669 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Normal voice ] Ah, okay
This one's fun.

00:02:16.669 --> 00:02:19.272 align:start size:94% position:6%
Ah, well, you know,
to get into Meryl Streep,

00:02:19.272 --> 00:02:22.275
I kind of have to adjust my hair
a little bit.

00:02:22.275 --> 00:02:23.977 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ As Meryl Streep ]
Ah, well, you know...

00:02:23.977 --> 00:02:27.680
But I heard him exclaim,
as he drove out of sight,

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:32.952 size:88% position:44%
Meryl Christmas to all
and to all a good night!

00:02:32.952 --> 00:02:35.221 line:92%
-Chloe Fineman, everybody!

00:02:35.221 --> 00:02:37.290 align:start size:94% position:6%
That is how you do it
right there!

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:40.393 align:start size:94% position:6%
Chloe Fineman -- Check her out
on "Saturday Night Live"

00:02:40.393 --> 00:02:44.230 align:start size:94% position:6%
this weekend, which is all new
with host Timothée Chalame

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:44.764 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
and musical guest

00:02:44.764 --> 00:02:46.900 align:start size:94% position:6%
Bruce Springsteen
and the E Street band.

00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:50.436
We're gonna hear a lot fro
Chloe Fineman, everybody.

